{"retcode":0,"message":"OK","data":{"page":{"id":"2140","name":"回声轻叙","desc":"1.6版本活动","icon_url":"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/06/09/4521515/96330277d4bdb5a16df399aa0034efd7_8089089762153995674.PNG","header_img_url":"","modules":[{"name":"活动说明","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://upload-bbs.mihoyo.com/upload/2021/06/04/75276539/f7b746f1e76d9458402660acd9454e1f_8451963624790486466.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,s_600/quality,q_80/auto-orient,0/interlace,1/format,png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"border:1px solid rgb(245, 245, 245);vertical-align:;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e活动期间，收集指定数量的\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(17,17,17,1)\\\"\u003e「\u003c/span\u003e回声海螺\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(17,17,17,1)\\\"\u003e」\u003c/span\u003e，即可获得\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e芭芭拉衣装「闪耀协奏」、原石\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(17,17,17,1)\\\"\u003e等奖励。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动时间〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e1.6版本\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓参与条件〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(173,114,14,1)\\\"\u003e冒险等阶≥21级\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e〓活动说明〓\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e● 活动期间，旅行者可以前往海岛探索，收集\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(17,17,17,1)\\\"\u003e「\u003c/span\u003e回声海螺\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(17,17,17,1)\\\"\u003e」。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(190,26,29,1)\\\"\u003e※1.6版本结束后，将无法再前往海岛获取「回声海螺」，也无法获取海岛上的宝箱、任务奖励，请旅行者及时探索，获取奖励。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(190,26,29,1)\\\"\u003e※ 芭芭拉衣装「闪耀协奏」将会在1.6版本结束后上架角色装扮商城，售价为1680创世结晶。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\\\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\\n\\n\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1317","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"活动玩法","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/06/08/4521515/7146129f4fd6805d5659b0c0d4ce8d5c_2607520098094398053.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\",\"switch\":false,\"is_show_switch\":false}\n","style":""}],"id":"1318","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":true,"switch":true,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"活动攻略","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp sty